      "text": "- App also has the \n   same UI as browser\n- It also can be accesed \n  from filesystem\n    - upload: copy file to \n        this folder\n    - download: click save \n        for offline on file\n        options\n    - sync : automatic\n- App stores the files metadata\n    in app storage location,\n    so even when offline, ,metadata\n    can be viewed ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- App also has the \n   same UI as browser\n- It also can be accesed \n  from filesystem\n    - upload: copy file to \n        this folder\n    - download: click save \n        for offline on file\n        options\n    - sync : automatic\n- App stores the files metadata\n    in app storage location,\n    so even when offline, ,metadata\n    can be viewed ",
