    {
      "id": "t7RxFByztNkc9h3lmWU-2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7460.251950513032,
      "y": 1053.1824313932334,
      "width": 1011.7794189453125,
      "height": 425,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4s",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 569039932,
      "version": 1541,
      "versionNonce": 1753432892,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1761900317270,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n\n\n\nSendAttachment:\n- User sends req to chatserver via ws\n- chatserver requests a presigned url from blobstorage & sends it to client.\n- client then upload the media to s3 directly & once success , sends a req to chatserver.\n- chatserver gets list of participants from postgres chatparticipant table\n- Create entries into cassandra\n- Checks what all ws connections are open from the map\n    - for receipents online i.e ws open, \n        - chatserver sends the msgs via ws & once it receives acks, it removes the entry from cassandra\n    - for ws not open (i.e offlien or online but app closed )\n        - chatserver sends push notifications to receipants\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\n\n\n\nSendAttachment:\n- User sends req to chatserver via ws\n- chatserver requests a presigned url from blobstorage & sends it to client.\n- client then upload the media to s3 directly & once success , sends a req to chatserver.\n- chatserver gets list of participants from postgres chatparticipant table\n- Create entries into cassandra\n- Checks what all ws connections are open from the map\n    - for receipents online i.e ws open, \n        - chatserver sends the msgs via ws & once it receives acks, it removes the entry from cassandra\n    - for ws not open (i.e offlien or online but app closed )\n        - chatserver sends push notifications to receipants\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
