      "updated": 1761900298659,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "SendMsg:\n- User sends msg to chatserver via ws\n- chatserver gets list of participants from postgres chatparticipant table\n- Create entries into cassandra\n- Checks what all ws connections are open from the map\n    - for receipents online i.e ws open, \n        - chatserver sends the msgs via ws & once it receives acks, it removes the entry from cassandra\n    - for ws not open (i.e offlien or online but app closed )\n        - chatserver sends push notifications to receipants",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "SendMsg:\n- User sends msg to chatserver via ws\n- chatserver gets list of participants from postgres chatparticipant table\n- Create entries into cassandra\n- Checks what all ws connections are open from the map\n    - for receipents online i.e ws open, \n        - chatserver sends the msgs via ws & once it receives acks, it removes the entry from cassandra\n    - for ws not open (i.e offlien or online but app closed )\n        - chatserver sends push notifications to receipants",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "M7Y10wR-3oNN2bPLdX7S8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8570.689041223532,
      "y": 1133.784941985911,
      "width": 900.9593505859375,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 976735620,
      "version": 43,
      "versionNonce": 1928927108,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1761900335425,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "GetUpdates: \n- when user opens the app, ws will be established & a getUpdates req is sent to chatserver.\n- chatserver checks the cassandra for msgs for user. if exists sends them via ws \n- If the msg is of type media, client downloads the media directly using s3 link.\n- client sends ack, & chatserver removes the entry from cassandra. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "GetUpdates: \n- when user opens the app, ws will be established & a getUpdates req is sent to chatserver.\n- chatserver checks the cassandra for msgs for user. if exists sends them via ws \n- If the msg is of type media, client downloads the media directly using s3 link.\n- client sends ack, & chatserver removes the entry from cassandra. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
