      "originalText": "- Throughput:\n    - 100M DAU\n        Writes:\n            - ( 1 tweet + 20likes/retweets/replies + \n            - (100M posts/day = 100M/100k posts/sec = 1k/s\n        - 100M * 100 feedReq/user = 10^10/100k /s = 100k/s\n    ",
