      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Top-K most viewed videos of all time\n- Top-K most viewed videos of last month , week, day, hour \n- Tumbling windows & Sliding windows\n    - if today is tuesday, tumbling window means last \n        monday to last sunday\n- max k = 1000\n    - pagination not needed as k is small\n\nBelow the line:\n- Arbitrary time windows ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Top-K most viewed videos of all time\n- Top-K most viewed videos of last month , week, day, hour \n- Tumbling windows & Sliding windows\n    - if today is tuesday, tumbling window means last \n        monday to last sunday\n- max k = 1000\n    - pagination not needed as k is small\n\nBelow the line:\n- Arbitrary time windows ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
