    {
      "id": "Cil168JQV8tolrid9bbY8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 27475.234204497705,
      "y": -114.35177764051934,
      "width": 368.3957824707031,
      "height": 735,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bAR",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1670985605,
      "version": 425,
      "versionNonce": 808735866,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1772605947318,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Fare\n- id\n- riderId\n- src\n- dest\n- priceMap <Vehicle,Price>\n- etaMap <Vehicle,eta>\n\nRide\n- id\n- riderId\n- driverId?\n- fareId\n- status\n\nDriver\n- id\n- vehicle\n- loc {lon,lat}\n- locUpdatedAt\n- status: in_ride | available",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Fare\n- id\n- riderId\n- src\n- dest\n- priceMap <Vehicle,Price>\n- etaMap <Vehicle,eta>\n\nRide\n- id\n- riderId\n- driverId?\n- fareId\n- status\n\nDriver\n- id\n- vehicle\n- loc {lon,lat}\n- locUpdatedAt\n- status: in_ride | available",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "1vqPDj2B0WatnuiF3f9lO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 25152.200472986624,
      "y": 1076.6667694481641,
      "width": 1829.4910888671875,
      "height": 840,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bAS",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 539546923,
      "version": 1474,
      "versionNonce": 1009113146,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1772605961490,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "FR-1:\n- Rider sends getFareEst request over ws.\n- Riders svc \n    - calls 3rd party map svc (Google maps) to calculate dist,travel times\n    - applies companies pricing model\n    - stores the fare in DB and returns to client\n\nFR-2:\n- Rider sends bookRide req.\n- Rider svc creates a Ride entry in DB with status as REQUESTED & sends it to matching svc\n- Send \"FINDING_DRIVER\" msg to rider\n\nFR-3:\n- Drivers keep sending their location updates every few sec\n- Ride Matching svc queries DB to find the a list of driver sorted by proximity, whose status = available , whose locUpdateAt <30s; \n     & sends \"NEW_RIDE\" msg to drivers via driver-svc one at a time.\n    - It sends req to one driver, sleeps for 10s, wakesup and check ride status, \n        - if its still not accepted , it sends req to another driver, also send an msg like \"RIDE_EXPIRED\" to old driver\n        - if its still rejected , it sends req to another driver.\n\nFR-4:\n- Drivers respond back with ACT/RJT\n- Driver svc update Ride entry in DB with driverId , status. Also update driver status\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "FR-1:\n- Rider sends getFareEst request over ws.\n- Riders svc \n    - calls 3rd party map svc (Google maps) to calculate dist,travel times\n    - applies companies pricing model\n    - stores the fare in DB and returns to client\n\nFR-2:\n- Rider sends bookRide req.\n- Rider svc creates a Ride entry in DB with status as REQUESTED & sends it to matching svc\n- Send \"FINDING_DRIVER\" msg to rider\n\nFR-3:\n- Drivers keep sending their location updates every few sec\n- Ride Matching svc queries DB to find the a list of driver sorted by proximity, whose status = available , whose locUpdateAt <30s; \n     & sends \"NEW_RIDE\" msg to drivers via driver-svc one at a time.\n    - It sends req to one driver, sleeps for 10s, wakesup and check ride status, \n        - if its still not accepted , it sends req to another driver, also send an msg like \"RIDE_EXPIRED\" to old driver\n        - if its still rejected , it sends req to another driver.\n\nFR-4:\n- Drivers respond back with ACT/RJT\n- Driver svc update Ride entry in DB with driverId , status. Also update driver status\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
