    {
      "id": "AOVE4H9mox5fT_TEiiDzR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 23449.394440059736,
      "y": 948.2745940399991,
      "width": 1276.575439453125,
      "height": 525,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bAX",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1522355333,
      "version": 825,
      "versionNonce": 1389070213,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1772188822265,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non-Functional Requirements & Envelope estimations:\n1. No SPOF\n2. Consistency > Availability\n    - Shouldnt assign a ride to multiple drivers\n    - drivers shouldbnt be assigned multiple rides\n3. System Scale:\n        Rides per day : 10M  => (riders=10M, drivers=1M(assuming a driver takes 10 rides/day))\n        Throughput:\n            Rides : 10M * 2 (fare + ride req) / 10^5 = 200/s\n            Location Updates: 1M * (1/5) (sends onece every 5s) = 200k/s\n        Latency:\n            RideMatching: as min as possible <1min else fail the ride\n            Notifications: Real-time\n4. Handle surges (100k within hour) - MCG ground has 100k capacity\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non-Functional Requirements & Envelope estimations:\n1. No SPOF\n2. Consistency > Availability\n    - Shouldnt assign a ride to multiple drivers\n    - drivers shouldbnt be assigned multiple rides\n3. System Scale:\n        Rides per day : 10M  => (riders=10M, drivers=1M(assuming a driver takes 10 rides/day))\n        Throughput:\n            Rides : 10M * 2 (fare + ride req) / 10^5 = 200/s\n            Location Updates: 1M * (1/5) (sends onece every 5s) = 200k/s\n        Latency:\n            RideMatching: as min as possible <1min else fail the ride\n            Notifications: Real-time\n4. Handle surges (100k within hour) - MCG ground has 100k capacity\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "pwGEEr2_hP0KWeplQFx6_",
