      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n1. Takes in DSL/PromQL and using query translation pipeline, generates \n    corresponding SQL & queries Postgres\n\nquery=avg(cpu_usage{region=\"us-east\"})&start=A&end=B&step=60",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
