    {
      "id": "S3ktYlVpThtUnG2OefS6C",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -9693.809531386603,
      "y": -444.96418679818044,
      "width": 1370.599609375,
      "height": 245,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bRi",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1085537977,
      "version": 567,
      "versionNonce": 1698592951,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773929780225,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- When a user first connects, he gets all the edits for that docId\n- When user sends an edit, OT server transforms it, by checking Edits history\n    - get all edits where seqNo > {clientSeqNo} & userId != {clientId} \n    - transform incomingOp against all these ops\n    - write this transformed Op to Edits table\n    - Identify connected clients for this docId & send this Edit to all\n    - Clients will then transform this remoteOp against their pending localOps and add it",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- When a user first connects, he gets all the edits for that docId\n- When user sends an edit, OT server transforms it, by checking Edits history\n    - get all edits where seqNo > {clientSeqNo} & userId != {clientId} \n    - transform incomingOp against all these ops\n    - write this transformed Op to Edits table\n    - Identify connected clients for this docId & send this Edit to all\n    - Clients will then transform this remoteOp against their pending localOps and add it",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
